#PCJ Playground#
PCJCHT PCJ Playground
PCJH01 You have ~1~ seconds to collect ~y~20~w~ checkpoints.
PCJH02 ~y~PASS THROUGH~w~ the first checkpoint within in time limit.
PCJCKH ~1~ of 20!

#RC Raider Pickup#
RCPTLT RC Raider Pickup
RCHPST Checkpoints Left
RCPH01 Use the RC Helicopter to collect many checkpoints scattered throughout the airport possible in the time limit
RCPH02 There are ~1~ Checkpoints in total
RCPH03 If you wish to quit this mission press ~k~~VEHICLE_ENTER_EXIT~ or Enter to Detonate Vehicle
RCSCRH You got checkpoint is: ~1~
RCPLSR ~r~You have left the RC Raider Pickup!
RCPLSE ~r~Try again Later!

#Shooting Range#
VCSHRG Shooting Range
BJM_FR FIRE!
BJM2_2 To exit the area Hold press ENTER button
BNK2_3 Time's up!
BJM2_15 SCORE
BJM2_18 SCORE TO BEAT
BJM2_19 Hit as many targets as you can in the time limit!
BJM2_20 When you run out of time or ammunition the round is over!
BJM2_22 ~r~You have left the shooting range!
BJM2_23 If you leave the shooting range during the competition, you will fail the mission.
BJM_SCR You Result score is: ~1~
BJM_SRA You score is: ~1~
BJM_LSE ~r~Try again Later!

